  "prefLabel": "Bfc 210.01 Adjudicative Proceedings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bfc 210.01 Adjudicative Proceedings.\n\n(a) Any adjudicative proceedings brought before the board for resolution shall be conducted as required by law, in accordance with the Jus 800 rules.\n\nSource. #10553-A, eff 3-25-14\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/bfc200.html"
